@startuml swimlane_sv4_04_reconciliation
title SV4-04 Bank Reconciliation (UC054) and Advertiser Receivables (UC053)

scale max 4000 width
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam conditionStyle InsideDiamond
skinparam roundCorner 0
skinparam swimlane {
  BorderColor #000000
  TitleBackgroundColor #66BBE2
  TitleFontStyle bold
}
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor white
  BorderColor #000000
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
  DiamondBorderColor #000000
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFE0
  BorderColor #999999
}

|Accountant|
|LocalPress Backend|
|Bank Statement|
|Chief Accountant|

|Accountant|
start
:Open /backoffice/finance/reconciliation;
|LocalPress Backend|
:System total of the month: SUCCESS,
excluding REFUND and WALLET payments;
|Bank Statement|
:Gateway / statement total;
note right
Demo: statement total = system total,
discrepancy list is sample data
end note
|LocalPress Backend|
:List discrepancies, period status
OPEN / RECONCILED / CLOSED;
|Accountant|
while (UNRESOLVED item\nand period open?) is (yes)
  :Investigate: complaint (UC051),
refund (UC055) or explain;
  :Enter resolution note;
  |LocalPress Backend|
  :Mark RESOLVED
(who, when, note);
  |Accountant|
endwhile (no)
:View advertiser receivables (UC053);
note right
API /finance/receivables only,
no screen yet
end note
|LocalPress Backend|
switch (Debt group per campaign?)
case (paid in full)
  :PAID_IN_FULL;
case (before end date)
  :IN_TERM;
case (past end date)
  :OVERDUE + days overdue,
alert DEBT_OVERDUE (UC060);
endswitch
|Accountant|
:Click "Close period";
if (Chief accountant role?) then (no)
  |Accountant|
  :Blocked: chief accountant only;
else (yes)
  |Chief Accountant|
  :Confirm closing
(warned if discrepancy left);
  |LocalPress Backend|
  :Period CLOSED,
resolving is locked;
endif
|Accountant|
:See period status;
stop

@enduml
